�傛晠锛屾垜鍦ㄨ繖閲岀粰浣犲洖澶嶃�備綘鏄�瀛︾敓锛屽厛鎶婂�︿範鏂归潰鐨勪簨寮勫ソ浜嗭紝鍐嶇湅涔﹀晩銆傞『渚匡紝閫佷簡浣�800娼囨箻甯侊紝缁欎綘鐪嬩功銆傛�讳箣锛屼互瀛︿负涓诲晩锛�"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "腹黑狂女:倾城召唤师", "content_zh": "腹黑狂女 倾城召唤师骆惊风看着凌飞扬的背影，想出声叫住他，但是无奈他走的太快，眨眼就跑到广场下面去了。骆惊风其实也并不想出现这样的结果。凌飞扬是凌家极为重视的新秀，虽然他不能成为召唤师，但是他已经是大地剑士。尽管诸葛明月刚才召唤出了魔宠，但是看那魔宠的样子，骆惊风可不认为她资质很好。这样的人，根本不配凌飞扬当她的守护师。最重要的一点，那就是凌家和诸葛家的关系并不好。若是凌飞扬当上诸葛明月的守护师……骆惊风有些不敢想下去了。他急忙拔腿追了上去，凌飞扬现在正在意气用事，希望可以劝说他回心转意。但是，作为凌飞扬最好的朋友，骆惊风明白，凌飞扬一旦决定的事，就很难改变了。这个时候诸葛明月正把头上的肥鹦鹉抱了下来，和它大眼瞪小眼。“主人，你长的真漂亮。”肥鹦鹉张口就来了一串恭维的话，“你就像那天上的明月，照亮我的心。主人，你的身材也好，虽然你穿的不怎么样，但是依旧不能迷惑我那犀利的眼神，据我目测，你的胸应该……呜呜，嗯嗯……”好吧，肥鹦鹉的嘴又被诸葛明月捂上了。诸葛明月狠狠的瞪了眼肥鹦鹉，恶狠狠的威胁道：“你再给我胡说八道，我就把你的鸟毛扒光，直接烤来吃掉。明白没有？”肥鹦鹉小眼睛瞪着诸葛明月，用力的点头表示明白了。诸葛明月这才放开它的嘴，谁知一放开，它就来句：“啊，主人，那你不是很流氓，扒光我的毛，就等于脱光我衣服啊。”“你身材那么肥，有什么好看的？”诸葛明月有些哭笑不得，但是还是好心情的打击着它。她有个预感，以后的日子，有这个肥鹦鹉在会很精彩！“我这不是肥，我这叫魁梧有力，知道么？对了，主人，我叫帅哥。以后你叫我帅帅，或者小帅帅就好了。”肥鹦鹉聒噪着，滔滔不绝，那自恋臭屁的样子看的诸葛明月一头黑线。还叫帅哥？“哇，诸葛，你好厉害，召唤的魔宠都会说话的。”正在诸葛明月觉得好笑的时候，一个声音插了进来。然后万俟辰那微胖的身子就挤到面前来了，笑嘻嘻的看着她。此刻的万俟辰还顶着个大猪头，那是早上被诸葛明月踩的。他身后跟着一脸无奈的薛子皓。诸葛明月斜着眼睛看了眼万俟辰，眉毛微挑，正准备说话，那肥鸟就开口了：“哟，这是谁？怎么一个头是两个大？”“我叫万俟辰。你好，你好。你刚才出现的时候真是拉风啊。真是天地变色，万物静止啊。”万俟辰嘿嘿笑着对肥鹦鹉说道，丝毫不介意肥鹦鹉的冷嘲热讽。那狗腿的样子看的在后面的薛子皓嘴角直抽搐。“那是当然。嗯嗯，你身材也不错嘛。好吧，小爷勉强收了你当，恩恩，呜呜……”肥鹦鹉听着万俟辰的话，那是心花怒放，得意忘形，话说到后面，诸葛明月已经冷着脸捂住了肥鹦鹉的嘴巴。“你有事？”诸葛明月冷冷的看着一脸憨笑的万俟辰，淡淡问道。“没事。啊不，不是。有事。”万俟辰挠头，憨笑着，“那个，明日你有没有时间啊，我们，一起去召唤师协会参加初级召唤师的考核啊。”万俟辰其实是鼓起勇气问出这句话的。而且，也做好了被拒绝的准备。他可是记得很清楚他现在顶着个猪头的原因的。“好啊。”诸葛明月却简短的吐出两个字来。“呵呵，其实我知道你不会答应的啊。我想你也没有时间，啊啊啊啊啊啊！你答应了啊，喔哈哈哈哈。”万俟辰刚开始还没回过神，自说自话的叨念着，后面的薛子皓狠狠的掐了一下他腰上的肥肉，他才回过神来，诸葛明月答应了。“那，那明天啊，明天早上我去你家门口等你啊。”万俟辰欢喜的搓着手，高兴的不知所以。“嗯，好。”诸葛明月却还是简单的一句话。万俟辰正要说什么，却感觉到身后一阵**。他转过身去，就看到一华服的俊美男子脸上带着魅惑的笑容，正走向这边。所到之处，众人自动让开来，周围人的视线都集中在了他的身上。“是凌飞扬。”薛子皓小声的说道。凌飞扬的大名，很多人都知道，这不奇怪。奇怪的是，他怎么往他们这边来了？诸葛明月也看到了凌飞扬，在记忆中，诸葛明月记起了这个人。回忆起后，她眉头微蹙。若是用她的话来定义这个人，这个人就是个自以为是的花花公子。“美丽的诸葛小姐，你好。”正在诸葛明月思索这凌飞扬为何冲他们过来的时候，凌飞扬已经站在她的面前彬彬有礼的开口了，再配上他俊美脸上的魅惑笑容，更是看的附近的女生心神荡漾，面容绯红。此刻凌飞扬也在心中感叹着，这诸葛明月虽然穿着没有品位，但是，容貌却是一等啊。还有她眉间的那股自信，更是吸引人的眼光。她简直就是一块璞玉，若是好好打造，必然是一个吸引人的尤物啊。“有事？”诸葛明月的口气明显有些不耐烦。凌飞扬微微一愣，看着眼前人儿眼中那掩饰不住的不耐，他有些不适应了。第一次，有女人用这样的态度对他。不过，没关系，若是等自己说出目的，眼前的人恐怕欣喜若狂吧。必然会迫切的接受自己做她的守护师。“当然有事。美丽的诸葛小姐，不知在下是否有幸成为你的守护师，用我的心和名誉来守护你。”凌飞扬微微一笑，定定的看着诸葛明月，缓缓的一字一句的说着。周围先是一片寂静，接着轰然喧哗起来！不可能吧！赫赫有名的凌飞扬居然想做诸葛明月的守护师？这是为什么？发生了什么？而周围的女生，特别是女的召唤师们，眼神全部射在诸葛明月的身上，恨不得在她身上射出几个窟窿出来。那是又羡又妒！万俟辰和薛子皓也是被眼前所发生的事情震惊的说不出话来。谁也没有想到凌飞扬过来的目的居然是这个！凌飞扬嘴角微微勾起一抹魅惑的弧度，露出完美的笑容，对他自己造成的轰动非常满意。而现在他也在信心满满的等待着诸葛明月的回答。然而……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Luo Jingfeng, the dark-bellied madwoman, looked at Ling Feiyang's back and wanted to stop him, but he walked too fast and ran under the square in the blink of an eye. Luo Jingfeng actually didn't want such a result. Ling Feiyang is a rookie that the Ling family attaches great importance to. Although he cannot become a summoner, he is already an earth swordsman. Although Zhuge Mingyue had just summoned a demon pet, looking at the appearance of the demon pet, Luo Jingfeng did not think that she was very qualified. Such a person is not worthy of Ling Feiyang being her guardian. The most important point is that the relationship between the Ling family and the Zhuge family is not good. If Ling Feiyang became Zhuge Mingyue's guardian... Luo Jingfeng didn't dare to think about it anymore. He hurriedly chased after him, but Ling Feiyang was now trying to persuade him to change his mind. However, as Ling Feiyang's best friend, Luo Jingfeng understood that once Ling Feiyang decided, it would be difficult to change it. At this time, Zhuge Mingyue was picking up the fat parrot on his head and staring at it with big eyes. \"Master, you are so beautiful.\" The fat parrot opened his mouth and said a string of compliments, \"You are like the bright moon in the sky, lighting up my heart. Master, you have a good figure, and although you are not well-dressed, you still can't confuse my sharp eyes. According to my visual inspection, your breasts should... Wuwu, um...\" Well, the fat parrot's mouth was covered by Zhuge Mingyue again. Zhuge Mingyue glared at the fat parrot, and threatened fiercely: \"If you continue to talk nonsense to me, I will strip off your bird feathers, roast them and eat them directly. Do you understand?\" The fat parrot stared at Zhuge Mingyue with its small eyes, and nodded vigorously to express understanding. Only then did Zhuge Mingyue let go of its mouth. Unexpectedly, as soon as he let go, it said: \"Ah, master, you are not a rogue. Taking off my hair is equivalent to taking off my clothes.\" \"You are so fat, what's so good about you?\" Zhuge Mingyue was a little confused about whether to laugh or cry, but he still hit him in a good mood. She had a hunch that it would be wonderful to have this fat parrot around in the future! \"I'm not fat, I'm strong and strong, you know? By the way, Master, my name is Handsome. From now on, you can just call me Handsome, or Little Handsome.\" The fat parrot was noisy and gushing, and Zhuge Mingyue's head turned black with his narcissistic look. Call him handsome? \"Wow, Zhuge, you are so powerful. The demon pets you summon can all talk.\" Just when Zhuge Mingyue felt funny, a voice interrupted. Then Wan Qichen's slightly fat body squeezed in front of her and looked at her with a smile. At this moment, Wan Qichen was still wearing a big pig's head, which was stepped on by Zhuge Mingyue in the morning. Behind him was Xue Zihao, who looked helpless. Zhuge Mingyue glanced sideways at Wan Qichen, raised his eyebrows slightly, and was about to speak, when the fat bird spoke: \"Hey, who is this? Why is one head two big?\" \"My name is Wan Qichen. Hello, hello. You were so cool when you appeared just now. The color of the world is really changing, and everything is still.\" Wan Qichen said to the fat parrot with a smile, not minding the cynicism of the fat parrot at all. The corners of Xue Zihao's mouth twitched when he saw the dog-legged look behind him. \"Of course. Hmm, you have a good figure too. Well, I reluctantly accepted you as my friend, eh, uh-huh...\" The fat parrot listened to Wan Qichen's words, feeling elated and elated. When he finished speaking, Zhuge Mingyue had already covered the fat parrot's mouth with a cold face. \"Are you okay?\" Zhuge Mingyue looked coldly at Wan Qichen, who had a naive smile on his face, and asked lightly. \"It's okay. Ah, no, it's something.\" Wan Qichen scratched his head and smiled naively, \"Um, do you have time tomorrow? Let's go to the Summoners Association to take the junior summoner assessment together.\" Wan Qichen actually mustered up the courage to ask this question. Also, be prepared for rejection. He remembers clearly the reason why he is wearing a pig's head now. \"Okay.\" Zhuge Mingyue said two words briefly. \"Haha, actually I know you won't agree. I don't think you have time either, ahhhhhhh! You agreed, oh hahahahaha.\" Wan Qichen didn't come back to his senses at first, mumbling to himself. Xue Zihao behind him pinched the fat on his waist hard, and he came back to his senses. Zhuge Mingyue agreed. \"Then, then tomorrow, I will wait for you at your door tomorrow morning.\" Wan Qichen rubbed his hands happily, so happy that he didn't know why. \"Well, okay.\" Zhuge Mingyue said simply. Wan Qichen was about to say something when he felt a wave of excitement behind him. He turned around and saw a handsome man in fine clothes walking towards him with a charming smile on his face. Wherever he went, everyone moved out of the way automatically, and the eyes of the people around him were all focused on him. \"It's Ling Feiyang.\" Xue Zihao said softly. Ling Feiyang's name is known to many people, which is not surprising. The strange thing is, why did he come to them? Zhuge Mingyue also saw Ling Feiyang. In his memory, Zhuge Mingyue remembered this person. She frowned slightly after recalling it. If she uses her words to define this person, he is a self-righteous playboy. \"Beautiful Miss Zhuge, hello.\" When Zhuge Mingyue was thinking about why Ling Feiyang came to them, Ling Feiyang had already stood in front of her and spoke politely. Coupled with the charming smile on his handsome face, it made the nearby girls' hearts flutter and their faces blush. At this moment, Ling Feiyang was also sighing in his heart. Although Zhuge Mingyue was not dressed tastefully, his appearance was first-class. And the confidence between her brows is even more eye-catching. She is simply a piece of jade. If she is well crafted, she will definitely be an attractive beauty. \"Is something wrong?\" Zhuge Mingyue's tone was obviously impatient. Ling Feiyang was slightly startled, looking at the unconcealable impatience in the eyes of the person in front of him.", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}